      "message": "My vote was supposed to be a +1.\n\nNo, `kernel/common` is never automatically merged.\n\nGorier details: This branch was forked off from `android-mainline` before `6.18` was tagged upstream. There may have been some manual merges. Future (manual) merges will be from `android-17-6.18-lts` which itself takes merges and other fixes from the Linux stable branch. `android-mainline` receives merges from upstream branches plus a small amount of non-upstream development.",
